function lessonStart(index=null,forceWatch=false){lessonWorker?.terminate();lessonWorker=null;clearTimeout(lessonTimer);const selected=Number.isInteger(index)?(index+GUIDED_LESSONS.length)%GUIDED_LESSONS.length:dueLessonIndex(),practice=selected!=null&&lessonStartMode==='practice'&&!forceWatch;lessonState={index:selected??0,phase:selected==null?'rest':practice?'try':'watch',step:0,playing:selected!=null&&!practice,hint:false,message:'',...(practice?{attempt:[],premove:null,waiting:false}:{})};selectedSquare=null;render();lessonSchedule()}
